# File .bat cua Windows PHAI giu nguyen ket thuc dong CRLF va byte goc.
# Danh dau -text (nhu binary) de git KHONG chuyen doi LF/CRLF khi commit/checkout,
# va de raw.githubusercontent (update.py tai ve) tra ve dung byte da commit.
# Neu de git tu chuyen thanh LF, chay tren cmd.exe se bi nuot ky tu dau dong
# (color->olor, echo->cho, set->et, if->f...) khien start.bat loi.
*.bat -text

# Script Unix giu LF
*.sh text eol=lf
